# HigTree is tab-indented: 8368 tab-indented lines against 954 space-indented,
# the inverse of higflow/. Everything else is inherited from the root
# .clang-format, including ColumnLimit: 0 and the note that this file
# describes the existing style rather than authorising a bulk reformat.

BasedOnStyle: InheritParentConfig
UseTab: Always
TabWidth: 4
IndentWidth: 4
